-- 600: the Stage & Spotlight tile is retired and its scenes rehomed (Kevin 2026-09-30: "too thin of a niche for an
-- entire tile ... some could probably move to LA or Hollywood"; he took the suggestion and asked to remove the scenes
-- that fit nowhere: "they sound lame if they can't fit into any category"). SCENARIO_LOCATION_SCOPE.md.
