-- Sonnet-sorted, 691 scenes: remove 306, 1920s speakeasy 36, los angeles 69, red carpet 73, new york city 13, las vegas 127, paris 24, london 11, retro decades 29, 1950s americana 3.
-- "remove" = the unnamed opera houses (a New York guess) and scenes with no stage or fame identity: disabled (reversible),
-- and only when no other place still holds them. Re-runnable.

